1 0 0 1 58 702 Tm (One central idea in The Master Key System is the relationship between the world within) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 687 Tm (and the world without. Haanel invites the reader to examine inner patterns influencing) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 672 Tm (how we see, choose and act.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 649 Tm (The world within) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 615 Tm (The world within describes thoughts, beliefs, images, emotions and purposes that give) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 600 Tm (direction to action. Haanel presents this inner world as a source of possibility; a) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 585 Tm (careful reading keeps the claim grounded: thought influences attention, interpretation) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 570 Tm (and action rather than automatically creating every external event.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 547 Tm (The world without) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 513 Tm (The world without is the visible part of life: environment, responsibilities,) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 498 Tm (relationships, habits and results. This does not deny external events, other people's) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 483 Tm (choices or genuine difficulty; it invites examination of the choices and actions over) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 468 Tm (which we do have influence.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 445 Tm (Harmony within) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 411 Tm (Harmony means bringing greater agreement between what you believe, want, imagine, say and) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 396 Tm (do. It does not mean life will always feel easy. Greater coherence can make deliberate) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 381 Tm (action easier.) Tj
/F1 15 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 358 Tm (Thought and action) Tj
/F1 10.5 Tf
1 0 0 1 58 324 Tm (The system does not present thought as a substitute for action. A definite purpose needs) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 309 Tm (practical expression through decisions, habits and consistent effort. The world within) Tj
1 0 0 1 58 294 Tm (provides direction; the world without provides opportunity.) Tj
